  "cards": [
    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "普通性能数据的落库内容",
      "items": [
        "HostManager::PersistTask 由单独 PersistenceWorker 消费；WriteToMysql 在 ENABLE_MYSQL 下启动事务并先写 server_performance。",
        "主表同时保存 CPU/load/memory/disk/network 当前值、兼容 resource score、health_score/anomaly/confidence/top_signals，以及多类变化率。",
        "同一写入函数继续写 server_net_detail、server_softirq_detail、server_mem_detail、server_disk_detail；这些表的字段和单位由 init_server_performance.sql 定义。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "rose",
      "title": "诊断 durable copy 的原子边界",
      "items": [
        "只有 task.incident 存在时调用 DiagnosticPersistence::Save；先 upsert diagnostic_incident，再重写 diagnostic_root_cause 和 diagnostic_evidence。",
        "主表、根因和 evidence 的诊断保存共享 START TRANSACTION；任意 Execute/查询失败都会 rollback，避免半条诊断链。",
        "保存失败时 Incident 仍留在 Manager 内存；QueryService 通过 IsDiagnosticPersistenceDegraded 选择 MySQL 或 IncidentStore。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "emerald",
      "title": "对外真正提供的 response",
      "items": [
        "QueryPerformance 返回 PerformanceRecord：当前资源值、resource/health/anomaly 字段、top_signals 和变化率，并带 total_count/page/page_size。",
        "QueryScoreRank/QueryLatestScore 返回 ServerScoreSummary；最新查询额外计算 ClusterStats，包括 avg/max/min score 与 health_score 以及 healthiest/least healthy server。",
        "QueryNetDetail、QueryDiskDetail、QueryMemDetail、QuerySoftIrqDetail 提供详情；Incident API 返回 active、severity、root_causes[] 和 evidence[]，持久化异常时回退内存。"
      ]
    }
  ]
